178009886707352184_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vdIB01QMk_MQ7kNvwG3fqpH&_nc_oc=AdkK3UBP7EltLXFdisosreLsiBDX2de4UBlAcFObkbloAuMtZl_XvG286KZhDXUdNe0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvO53Mk9fNpxQvM06XiOgfDpty2ID4CANkhuPT66evFdA&oe=69A574DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TaskTitan_2560x1440.png", "id": "318678027752199", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982572_318678031085532_2872445775829117351_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iCtWj46dV6YQ7kNvwEWCCXh&_nc_oc=Adl2dKNixzjNDPE9iG1x6RzuWmcA2n0GjiMeUMawScWCi9s3C9WC_WWiWiPrAosWCU8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv7ozo831qUej_SX5lX2DVs_Ly2QJj4BU3L7t-iOMybcQ&oe=69A599B0"}, "display_name": "Task Titans", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Task Titans is a series of 3 virtual reality mini games intended to teach the player project management concepts. \n\nDefeat Gremlins:\nOvercome risks and issues by battling gremlins, enhancing your problem-solving skills.\n\nBridge Building: \nConstruct one of multiples bridges types,  applying project management principles to ensure success.\n\nResource Management & Team Coordination:\nManage resources wisely and work with a team to bring your bridge project to completion.\n\nLearn Valuable Life Skills:\nGain insights into leadership, teamwork, strategic planning, and adaptability through real-life project scenarios.\n \nExperience:\nWhether a beginner or a seasoned pro, \"The Task Titans\" offers a fun and educational way to sharpen your project management skills.", "short_description": "Jump into the role of a project manager in \"The Task Titans,\" where you'll tackle various challenges from saving spaceships to constructing bridges and solving treasure maps."}]}, "developer_name": "START", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://taleoconnects.com/privacypolicy-tasktitans", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Taleo", "su